WEBVTT

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:07.490
I don't believe this.

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:10.050
Even in it's current state, it's
starting to rejuvenate.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.430
1,000 years...

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.330
Heart rate slowing down!

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:16.830
Prep the defibrillator!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.470
Keep massaging the heart!

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.740
Hurry, the SSDF will be
here any moment!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.840
A helicopter is ready to go.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:24.980
Take him to Chitose and then
to Iruma from there.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.080
Yes, the experiment itself
was a failure.
Take him to Chitose and then
to Iruma from there.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.210
Yes, the experiment itself
was a failure.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.180
But we were able to collect
a wide body of data.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:33.920
I understand.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:34.490
I understand.
Second and third arresting
hinges secured.

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:36.050
Yes, I'll have it all taken
care of by day's end.
Second and third arresting
hinges secured.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:38.260
Yes, I'll have it all taken
care of by day's end.
Liquid Z, all retrieved.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:40.690
We've retrieved the micro battery,

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:44.060
but it appears that it will take a
while to collect all the fragments.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:47.060
Leave it! They were blown
apart by the artillery.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.460
Just hurry in carrying everything
back to the rear.

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:59.170
It's General Gowa of Ichigaya, Sir.

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.750
Yoshidake?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.310
So, what have you found out?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.650
Just as we figured, it
was in Hokkaido,

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:13.690
but I wasn't able to get a good
grasp of what they were doing.

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.060
No, that's okay.

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:19.360
I've got a good guess as to
what they were up to.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.030
Issue the order to retrieve
Yushiro at once.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.630
Yes, I'm counting on you.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.580
Message to the motor pool?

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.380
Yes, Sir, right away.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.680
Yes, that's fine.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.080
It will look like they were
transporting the Seventh's Type 90.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:38.750
ETA 2300 at Chitose, correct?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.250
And the model? C-130?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.490
Yes, then we'll have the
B pallet prepared.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.990
That's right, we'll head
to Iruma right away.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.190
Yes, please have transporters
standing by.

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:48.360
What of the variable stress
progression data?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:51.800
We'll need the supercomputer back
at the labs to analyze that.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:56.000
I'll send you my address so please
have it sent to my server there.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.940
What's going on?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:04:02.440
They say they're sending the TA's
data to Gowa's laboratory.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:03.510
The Central Research Facility?

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:05.510
Mr. Yonetani, please come here.

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:08.810
I see. I suppose it was
rushed slightly.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.680
But I thought the TA's data was
supposed to be handed to Gowa

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.780
And on your end?
But I thought the TA's data was
supposed to be handed to Gowa

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.420
And on your end?
after it had gone through the
Defense Ministry Research Center?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.220
after it had gone through the
Defense Ministry Research Center?

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:14.620
I see. We'll be able to handle
that incident from this end.
after it had gone through the
Defense Ministry Research Center?

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.220
It's not just the data.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.750
They're going to take that pilot
to a Gowa medical facility.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:24.700
Whatever's going on here
is definitely not kosher.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.560
There was that pilot,

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:31.300
and now there's a lot of fuss as if
they're trying to cover this up.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:35.860
Agreed. I'll probably have to be here
for another two or three days.

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.300
Captain Gowa?! We've got
a situation here.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:46.110
Hold on. I'll contact you later.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:50.920
Maybe it's wrong to ask you just
because you're a Gowa,

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:53.590
but I have no one else I can ask.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.190
So please, if you know
what's going on...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:55.530
Who brought this in?
So please, if you know
what's going on...

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:56.690
Who brought this in?

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.100
Resembled a TA?

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.930
Yes, but it wasn't a TA.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:05.970
It was more organic.

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:07.770
Organic?

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.540
Something about it seemed
unlike any machine.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:21.020
That's why the experiments being
conducted here bother me.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.580
Some type of biological weapon?

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.860
I'm not sure if you can treat it
purely as a biological weapon,

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:32.760
but things do fall into place if
some new biotechnology

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.960
was behind the research
that's going on.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.270
There were these questions that
we all harbored inside,

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.860
but we didn't dare mention them.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.540
Why does the TA's phase
capacity transition

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.740
only occur in response
to Captain Gowa?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.750
How do those improvements occur
not only in Captain Gowa's TA,

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.180
but also in all the TA's
in the company?

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.820
That strange weapon that
resembled a TA...

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:10.060
The experiments that were
being conducted here...

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:19.210
Even if Gowa is hedging all their
bets on the success of the TA's

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.510
they wouldn't dare
threaten the life

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:25.380
of a member of their family,
Captain Gowa, would they?

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:26.710
Member of the family?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.320
I don't know.

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.030
But...

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:44.230
But I am sure that both
that pilot and I

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:47.470
are subjects taken advantage of by
the Gowa in their experiments.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:48.700
Experiments?

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.210
...is referred to by them
as the subject.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.150
Test subject...

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:57.550
What's happened?

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.680
Captain Gowa is being
ordered to return.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.390
Orders for Yushiro?

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:05.720
But I thought the deployment of the
TA company was kept under wraps.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.490
Well, I'm doing my best to find
out more about this.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.930
Captain Gowa?

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:15.420
I will never forgive you for
what you've done! Ever!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.770
Colonel!

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:25.110
I've discovered where the order for
Captain Gowa's return originated.

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:28.780
Order to return?

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:33.840
The 5th Staff Offices?

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:36.150
Major General Gowa!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.350
Major General Gowa? Chairman
Gowa's younger brother?

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.730
Do you remember, Misuzu?

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:53.170
Neither Yushiro or you

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:57.670
could turn the weather wheel
without me holding you up.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.160
Father?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.580
Heart rate has exceeded 200.

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:10.520
Noradrenalin, 30% above
threshold levels.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.460
Data! I want more detailed data!

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:15.550
I heard you went to Kinashi.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.530
Her distribution of variables
is just like Yushiro.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:25.530
There's no question what this
girl's role was in Belgistan.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.840
You saw it?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.270
Yes.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:35.250
Father, you must tell me, what
was there and why?

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:37.980
That's the history of Gowa.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:42.350
Yes, the history that we left
behind 1,000 years ago.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.390
What's this?

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.920
The current corollary relationship
between the test subject

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.820
undergoing physical
examinations and Mile One.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.460
They seem to be moving in tandem.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.290
What does this mean?

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:57.730
Are you waiting? Waiting for
someone to come looking for you?

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:01.870
If that's the case, then you should
cast aside such foolish hopes.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:05.810
Japan is suffering from an influx
of illegal immigrants.

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:08.050
As part of safeguard against this,

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:12.220
the government has created a
complete database of all citizens.

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:19.150
It even includes the names of those
who enter Japan temporarily.

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:23.360
And if you are not in that
database, then...

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.930
You are an illegal immigrant!

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.990
As it so happens, you are not
listed in the database.

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:33.730
You are a person who is not
supposed to exist within Japan.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.770
It would be easy to dispose of you
without anyone finding out,

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:43.010
even if it means using you to come
one step closer to our goals.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:53.210
Dead?! Over eight years ago?

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.330
I've always been someone's
means to an end,

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:04.200
just like the test subject you
allowed to die eight years ago.

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.460
Dear brother...

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:26.950
Miharu...

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.460
You are a kai!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.760
The Silent Weapon...

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.360
Kazukiyo,

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:04.900
wasn't that what you called the
weapons manufactured in Japan?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.470
Weapons whose reason for
existence depended not on use,

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:13.030
but instead on deterrence and
the maintenance of silence.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:16.970
But as the power of silence
fades in time,

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:20.740
the principle behind its strategy is
eclipsed by endless power games.

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.080
The words you used to
justify your actions

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:25.220
were doubletalk!

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.550
Doubletalk?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:28.590
That's right, doubletalk.

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:31.590
Gowa deployed TA's in Belgistan

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:33.920
at the cost of subverting
the constitution.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:38.030
It was so TA's would not become
a mere ceremonial ornament,

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.960
a mere superficial weapon.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:49.870
Well, maybe that was our
intention originally.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:55.040
But those intentions became an
unquenchable thirst for power.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.610
When?

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.390
Just moments ago.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.690
Are you going to your father's?

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:09.560
Yes.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.190
I see.
Yes.

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.060
I see.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.090
You returned, not knowing why.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:21.410
When Yushiro resisted Gasaraki,

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:25.500
our ambitions were about
to be negated forever.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:32.270
But then, one flash of light out of
central Asia changed everything.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:38.320
It was nearly identical to the one
that carved in our stage of stone.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.160
Yes, we were not the only ones.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:46.400
Others were attempting
to contact Gasaraki.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:51.700
And if that light was the same as
the one on the stone stage,

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.370
then we were not about
to ignore it.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.810
No matter what the cost,
we needed to know.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:13:01.300
How did they summon
Gasaraki to come?

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.710
From that moment,

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:09.020
the incident in central Asia held
a different meaning for us.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:15.060
But you yourself approved the
actions carried out in Belgistan.

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:17.530
I approved.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:21.060
I was hoping we might learn

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:28.990
of an alternative method of coming
in contact with Gasaraki.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:34.470
But Kazukiyo, that was not the only
reason you ushered this through.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.450
He has arrived, Sir.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.790
Right, let him through.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:43.790
Who it is?

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:44.290
Yushiro.
Who it is?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.160
Yushiro.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:50.030
Yushiro? Why? Where has
he been until now?

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:51.700
Hokkaido.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:55.000
Hokkaido? What was in Hokkaido?

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.800
Human experimentation.

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:00.300
They were conducting experiments
on people

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:04.640
to see how pilots could better
adapt to operating TA's.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:09.580
Isn't that right, Yushiro?

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:10.910
Is that true?

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.080
Yes.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.920
Who's been doing things like that?

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:15.850
Mr. Yonetani was there.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.480
Mr. Yonetani?

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:19.480
Then...

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.520
Then what?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.760
The I-globulin.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.760
It was discovered during the
research on the Mile One.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:32.640
This compound is nearly identical
to a protein that Yushiro's body

00:14:32.640 --> 00:14:36.500
secretes when he's undergoing
a capacity phase transition.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.710
So, the idea was to improve
a regular pilot's ability

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.550
to operate the TA by injecting
this agent?

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.120
But I thought that project
was altered!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:53.290
The situation changed.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.730
After going through the parts that
were collected from Belgistan,

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:02.130
it was clear that the units were
manufactured by Symbol.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.860
Symbol?!

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.270
What are you doing?

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:16.110
That's our album, isn't it?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.610
You won't find Yushiro in there.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.620
He's not?

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.390
Not only there.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:27.290
There never will be a Yushiro,
ever again.

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:30.090
Is something the matter, Mother?

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:34.300
The long stagnant sediments
of desire in this house

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.790
are about to wither away.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.530
Yes, let them wither away.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.610
They're the world's largest
conglomerate.

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:45.040
No one has a clue as to how
vast their assets are.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.550
It not an organization Gowa could
ever hope to stand up against.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.250
They could crush us just like that.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:56.410
Kazukiyo doesn't intend for Gowa to
compete against Symbol alone.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:01.220
He's setting it up so that Japan
itself will confront Symbol.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:03.250
Japan?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.560
I understand you've been in contact
with Colonel Hirokawa of the SSDF.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.430
So you knew.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.770
Is it for lust of power?

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:13.870
I do not pursue such
a hollow illusion.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:18.380
Then are the words of Hiraku
Nishida a hollow illusion as well?

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:22.980
Nishida? Are you talking about the
man who espouses that Japan

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:24.280
become a totalitarian state
once more?

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:29.150
But that man advocated a
coup d'état to lead the...

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.750
That's just what Kazukiyo
is trying to do.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:38.530
That's one reason to rush ahead
with the development of TA's.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.730
Could it be the real motivation
of TA development for you?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.470
Kazukiyo, there are
only Gowa's here.

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:47.870
Out with your true intentions!

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:53.100
Long ago those empowered by kugai
and the Gasaraki sought something.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.300
You must know what that was.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:01.320
To be the puppet master and
rule from the shadows.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.390
A deluded ambition!

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:03.390
Why?

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:07.590
The kai sought out their path toward
survival by leaving behind

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:10.290
their role as master of the Gasaraki
ceremony 1,500 years ago.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:12.100
It's a life of hushed seclusion,

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:15.590
robbed of the opportunity to be
in the historical spotlight.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:20.330
But in the end, we are but a
military power clan.

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:25.880
Long ago, someone like you held
the same ambitions you hold now.

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.150
That man could not distance
himself from power,

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:33.480
and brought about internal strife.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.890
Do you intend to repeat
the folly of his ways?!

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:42.130
We are the only descendents of the
kai. Who will fight against us?

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.230
The Symbol will rise up this
time instead of the kai.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:46.860
We merely need to vanquish them.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.070
Has not this military
warrior family

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:54.200
withstood the passage of time over
a thousand years by doing so?

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:02.350
You speak of an eternally
spinning wheel,

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.210
the eternal transmigration
of terror.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.670
You have grown old.

00:18:10.220 --> 00:18:11.520
I see.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.920
It appears that there is vast chasm
between you and me

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:17.590
that no words could hope to bridge.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:22.550
Is that why you called upon
Kiyotsugu and Kiyoharu to be here?

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.970
We follow who we believe
to be worthy to lead us.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.030
That's the way of the Gowa.

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:35.240
I ask all those here whether they
will follow me or Kazukiyo.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.480
Wait a minute! Right here and now?

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:47.990
All those who wish for a new master
of the house, raise your hand.

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.980
Those who do not, keep silent.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:52.100
What about you, Yushiro?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.790
You must be joking.

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.440
Get Mr. Kiyotsugu on the line now!

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.790
Yes, can't it wait?

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:19.860
What? The kugai is...

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:23.120
All right, just let it be
until I get there.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.000
Father, I am a scientist.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.210
That's why

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:45.110
I am not about to abandon what's
happening right before my eyes.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:49.650
If working with Kazukiyo means
my research will progress...

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.010
Progress?

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.260
I suppose that might
come from this.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:06.400
It seems this issue
is now resolved.

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:31.730
Yushiro?

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.030
Sorachi Kengyo said to me

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:39.070
that my past awaits at the end
of the path of the kai.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:42.160
The homeland of the kai, Watanabe.

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:46.060
Our truth ends at the storehouse.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:53.440
But not yours. Your path
leads farther out.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:57.750
I suppose I am at the
end of my line.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:14.900
Why?!

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:16.390
Let's go.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.890
Yes...

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.380
Kiyoharu, what is it?

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:39.200
That woman from Symbol...

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.300
She's run off! Father led them?

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:46.330
Come to think of it,
it's only natural.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:49.760
So what should we do,
Master of the House?

00:21:50.710 --> 00:21:53.770
Go through Yushiro's room at once.

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:07.390
Are you sure you want
to walk from here?

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:09.690
By taking the path of the kai,

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:11.180
I feel that I might learn
more about myself.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:14.260
I don't know what that will be.

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:15.750
I see.

00:22:16.300 --> 00:22:19.290
I'll be going now, Father.

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.010
Father?

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:34.110
Hark

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:40.560
It's time I journey

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.230
Break apart my heart

00:22:51.400 --> 00:22:57.760
For crimson sadness

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:05.270
Pours out from it

00:23:05.480 --> 00:23:09.190
I can only, oh

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:12.380
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:12.470 --> 00:23:17.990
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:37.090
I can only, oh

00:23:37.180 --> 00:23:40.240
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:45.440
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:46.970 --> 00:23:53.420
I beg you, be by my side

00:24:01.100 --> 00:24:03.370
Something lurks under
the surface of Japan,

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:06.010
a ripe surface that resembles an
afternoon near the end of summer,

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:09.380
devoid of vitality and
pure freshness.

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:12.220
Strange that it should be so,

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:15.950
when time moves ahead evermore
steadfastly toward tomorrow.

00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:18.690
Set upon a path

00:24:18.690 --> 00:24:21.320
Back to the vivid past laid
out before them both

00:24:21.320 --> 00:24:24.450
The two companions tread upon
the sick wilting leaves

00:24:25.060 --> 00:24:28.430
We alone are traveling
toward the past.
